 shader if need be, let me know. We need the effect to work for all 7 islands. \n\n![image.png]([URL_51806])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-12-26T12:10:40Z", "completed_at": "2025-01-06T10:40:35Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 580854, "labels": ["VFX&SOUNDS"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-12-09T17:49:50Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-06T10:40:35Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/566", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ART-758", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ART", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ART-758", "number": 758, "title": "Simple splash effect for Nathan's Treasure Hunt Event", "description": "A very simple splash effect for Nathan's Treasure Hunt event for when the avatars will fall from the ship. This will take a split second so there is no need for an elaborate vfx. \n\n[[URL_51807])\n\nSomething like this will do but, up to you.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-12-27T11:50:21Z", "completed_at": "2024-12-30T21:33:44Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 590281, "labels": ["VFX&SOUNDS"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-12-09T17:53:47Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-30T21:33:44Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/606", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-114", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "