tle": "Organize GDDs", "description": "Merge all GDDs into one functional and updated document. Make sure the links to smaller documents are working properly.", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-10-14T18:41:23Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 701333, "labels": ["Main Game"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-08-04T20:24:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T17:40:24Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/656", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-16", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": "DES-7", "assignee_id": "usr_Robert", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-16", "number": 16, "title": "Add a leaderboard system for Mini Game #1", "description": "Leaderboard not for alpha, requires backend work.\n\nPersonal best stored locally, will be in alpha", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-05-05T17:39:28Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 409075, "labels": ["Improvement", "Mini Game"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "DES-17", "type": "blocks"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-08-04T21:19:54Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T17:39:28Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/667", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-17", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": "DES-16", "assignee_id": "usr_Robert", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-17", "number": 17, "title": "Propose percentile system for the leaderboard/personal best system", "description": "For alpha I think personal best is the better choice, as the score can be stored locally on client's device. Leaderboard will require backend service to keep track of global population and their scores.\n\nSub task created to update game end screen UI.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": "2023-08-08", "started_at": "2023-08-07T17:27:51Z", "completed_at": "2023-08-08T01:29:14Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1322020, "labels": ["Sprint 1 - August 18th", "Mini Game"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ART-116", "type": "relates"}, {"target": "ART-115", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-08-04T21:21:26Z", "updated_at": "2023-08-10T17:53:50Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/693", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-20", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-20", "number": 20, "title": "Move UX to the general Figma Board", "description": "Per our agreement with the art team, we will move our UX after they've been approved. They will be as rough mock-ups. The elements are listed as subtasks and will take priority after documentation organization for Sprint 1 - August 18th. \n\nSandbox Figma board: \n\n[[URL_13522])\n\nGoD Figma Board: \n\n[[URL_13521])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2023-08-18T16:55:10Z", "archived_at": "2024-02-19T00:06:31Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 1310559, "labels": ["Sprint 1 - August 18th", "UI/UX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2023-08-07T21:53:53Z", "updated_at": "2023-08-18T16:55:10Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/695", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-22", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": "DES-23", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-22", "number": 22, "title": "Rethink Vanishing tile", "description": "We have a concern with our vanishing tile. We need to think of elevating it or creating some alternatives for it", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": "2023-08-18", "started_at": "2023-08-10T15:56:31Z", "completed_at": "2023-08-16T14:52:47Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1310181, "labels": ["Sprint 1 - August 18th", "Main Game"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ENG-620", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-08-09T21:46:31Z", "updated_at": "2024-03-12T17:52:31Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/727", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-263", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-263", "number": 263, "title": "[Baklava] Check Localization", "description": "From the design side, we need to make sure tutorial and milestone previews are localized properly. \n\nThe localization is done from a JSON called I2Languages. Joe has a detailed video of how to use it in the tutorial editor channel. If you add something in the milestone preview or change something without engineers please update this document. Please continue my format with localization keys.\n\nFormat: Tutorials_TutorialName_OrderMessage  --> Tutorials_BundleTile_FirstMessage etc.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:45Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 701325, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor", "Localization"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-08-29T19:56:21Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:45Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/728", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-264", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": "DES-263", "assignee_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-264", "number": 264, "title": "Milestone Preview Check", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:43Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 701325, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-08-29T19:56:49Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:43Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/729", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-265", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": "DES-263", "assignee_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-265", "number": 265, "title": "Tutorial Localization Check", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:40Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 701325, "labels": ["Localization"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-08-29T19:57:18Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:40Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/730", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-266", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-266", "number": 266, "title": "[Baklava] Check Milestone Preview", "description": "Do a final check that the Milestone Preview is correct with order, icon, and text (plus localization)\n\nI updated this, but if you need to change anything, it is very easily done (and self explanatory) in the Milestone Preview json. For now we're missing a chest icon and I didn't put the train icon in yet (but I'll do it tonight and let you know if I can't make it)", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:34Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 701325, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-08-29T19:59:36Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:34Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/731", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-267", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-267", "number": 267, "title": "[Baklava] Tutorials", "description": "Please do a general run both on iOS and Android. [PERSON_NAME_0050] already does an FTUE QA anyway but it pays to do a couple of tutorial runs in the game.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:21Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 701325, "labels": ["FTUE", "Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-08-29T21:04:24Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:21Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/732", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-268", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": "DES-267", "assignee_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-268", "number": 268, "title": "New Bomb Tutorial", "description": "I asked for a fuse ignite event. Basically tell the players to fuse the bomb and match it to blow the tiles away.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:17Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 701325, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-08-29T21:05:01Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:17Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/733", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "DES-269", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_DES", "parent_id": "DES-267", "assignee_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "DES-269", "number": 269, "title": "New Minigame Hub Tutorial", "description": "To be updated (some issues with UIs)", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:14Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 701325, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-08-29T21:11:12Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-14T18:49:14Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data