er_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1715", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1825", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1825", "number": 1825, "title": "Tutorial Editor Updates", "description": "The new tutorial editor updates, as discussed and decided in the meeting.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-05-05T19:12:42Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 408982, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:10:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T19:12:42Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1716", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1826", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1825", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1826", "number": 1826, "title": "Highlight radius fix", "description": "We have a highlight radius feature but it's not working consistently at the moment.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-05-05T19:12:34Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 408982, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:10:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-27T08:42:11Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1717", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1827", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1825", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1827", "number": 1827, "title": "Input On/Off Feature", "description": "In addition to blocking inputs for a predetermined amount of time, we also need a way to turn them on and off without time constraints.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-11-16T17:55:15Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 653859, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:10:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-11-16T17:55:15Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1718", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1828", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1825", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1828", "number": 1828, "title": "Tutorial Terminator", "description": "A system to prematurely end tutorials in the sequence, based on a requirement such as an action, trigger event, or level.", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-12-06T16:52:21Z", "completed_at": "2025-01-16T18:07:32Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 566007, "labels": ["Sprint 27 Nova - Dec 6th", "Nova Release"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:10:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-16T18:07:32Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1719", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1829", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1825", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1829", "number": 1829, "title": "Think about a separate lock/unlock system", "description": "We're not doing this actively but since we found out the current block unblock logic makes things difficult to debug we will think about a way to lock and unlock things from a separate system, possibly remote configurable as well.", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-05-05T19:12:46Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 408982, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:10:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T19:12:46Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1721", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1830", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1825", "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1830", "number": 1830, "title": "Implement the hand sprite", "description": "We will use the hand in the Tile Dozer game as another feature for the tutorial editor. It already has the sprite and the animation. It just needs to be integrated into the tutorial editor as an action, similar to the pointer arrow logic.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-11-06T16:59:37Z", "completed_at": "2024-11-22T17:53:01Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 645221, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:10:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-11-22T17:53:01Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1722", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1831", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1825", "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1831", "number": 1831, "title": "Object and UI tags to be merged in one", "description": "The separation of object and UI tags are creating a chaos as we get more of them. We decided to merge the two, deriving only from the HarmonyObjectID", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-05-05T19:12:46Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 408982, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:10:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T19:12:46Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1723", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1832", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1825", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1832", "number": 1832, "title": "Tutorial Sequencer made more flexible", "description": "Sometimes if a tutorial fails for whatever reason, other tutorials will trigger from the order. We possibly want a better way to sequence the tutorials.", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-01-16T18:21:30Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 565993, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:10:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-16T18:21:30Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1737", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1845", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1825", "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1845", "number": 1845, "title": "Tag character token", "description": "I want to highlight the character token in the tutorial. Can we put a tag on it please?", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-11-05T00:10:41Z", "completed_at": "2024-12-03T11:52:47Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 629741, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T22:31:59Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-03T11:52:47Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1913", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2003", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2003", "number": 2003, "title": "Implement the new minigame popup", "description": "Please implement the new minigame screen at 2-12 as shown here. \n\n![image.png]([URL_51826])\n\n[[URL_51825])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-12-16T16:22:51Z", "completed_at": "2024-12-23T12:18:15Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 600916, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-12-13T15:43:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-23T12:18:15Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1915", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2005", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2005", "number": 2005, "title": "Tutorial Editor Can Play Sound Files On a Seperate Event", "description": "Right now our tutorial editor can play sound files as a part of the \"Show Message\" event. Please make it so that sounds can be played without using a text book as a well as a separate event.", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-12-13T17:32:19Z", "completed_at": "2024-12-30T12:11:12Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 590843, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-12-13T17:31:35Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-30T12:11:12Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1994", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2078", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2064", "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2078", "number": 2078, "title": "Create Generic VFXs for the event icon system", "description": "As discussed in the meeting, we need some generic animations we can use at the spur of the moment while developing the prototypes. We are missing the following to get this ticket going: \n\n1. Marcus will look into other games and what the current trends are \n2. Marcus will show us the options \n\nAfter that, we can build a few simple animations to use for any icon. The effects we considered are the document for the Event Icon System document, and they are size change, tilt, bounce, and sparkle. But those are just starting ideas and the list can be finalized after Marcus tackles the first two issues.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-20T14:13:22Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-05T09:34:18Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-11-06T04:09:46Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 409560, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-20T12:30:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T09:34:18Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1995", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2079", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2064", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2079", "number": 2079, "title": "Implement Generic VFXs into the icon system", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-30T17:56:40Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-11-06T04:09:45Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 530357, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-20T12:31:13Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1998", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2081", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2064", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2081", "number": 2081, "title": "The Display of The Icons on The Scene", "description": "The icons are shown on the screen as two columns and they can resize if need be. This includes the icons when they are in their locked state.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-27T17:35:26Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:59Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-11-06T04:09:45Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 530357, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-20T15:17:34Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:59Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1999", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2082", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2064", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2082", "number": 2082, "title": "Create the icon prefab", "description": "As a part of the system we have decided to use an icon prefab that has various UI elements that other event builders can call as needed.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-27T17:35:12Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-11-06T04:09:45Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 530357, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-20T15:18:35Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2000", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2083", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2064", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2083", "number": 2083, "title": "Create the Queue System", "description": "Creating the actual queue system that will control the sticky icons and the ordering of the other icons as needed.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-27T17:35:32Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-11-06T04:09:45Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 530357, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-20T15:20:03Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2001", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2084", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2064", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2084", "number": 2084, "title": "Create a test environment for the system", "description": "Since we only have 2 events, we need to create a test environment to test this feature out.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-27T17:35:40Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-11-06T04:09:45Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 530357, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-20T15:25:56Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-10T12:16:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2025", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2105", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2105", "number": 2105, "title": "Nathan's Treasure Hunt Avengers Improvements", "description": "We want to make a couple of improvements to the Avengers version of the game. The topics are as follows. Please see the subtasks for the detailed explanation. \n\n1. Flow Change\n2. Stage Presentation \n3. Icon Start Button", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-02-05T23:44:47Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-18T13:13:01Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 518781, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-01-23T17:38:15Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-18T13:13:01Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2026", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2106", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2105", "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2106", "number": 2106, "title": "Change the Restart Flow", "description": "We will remove the cooldown of the event. Any time the player fails, they can start the event again via the start button on the icon (see task three for more)", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-02-05T23:45:00Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-18T13:12:50Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 518781, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-01-23T17:40:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-18T13:12:50Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2027", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2107", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2105", "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2107", "number": 2107, "title": "Make Stages More Obvious", "description": "Right now, it's unclear which streak the players are currently at. Let's utilize the space we didn't use in the event UI that was meant for description and add a stage presentation there. If text won't be enough, we can try the icons.  Let's try and decide on the go.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-02-06T18:01:42Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-18T13:13:02Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 518781, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-01-23T17:43:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-18T13:13:02Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2028", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2108", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2105", "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2108", "number": 2108, "title": "Put a Start Button on the Icon", "description": "Whenever the event is ready to be played, the icon should have a start button on it instead of enrolling us automatically.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-02-06T18:01:39Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-18T13:13:02Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 518781, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-01-23T17:44:34Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-18T13:13:02Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2037", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2116", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2116", "number": 2116, "title": "Make Tiles Bigger in Core Game", "description": "We have decided that the tiles should be bigger in the game. I already experimented and it will take a 1-1 session to get everything right on engineering. The steps will be. \n\n1. Move Deck \n2. Make available tile count less\n3. Move Rewind \n4. Hide Coin HUD when in a level \n5. Make camera from 0.64 to 0.55\n6. Remove/reposition any animations \n7. Resize Sophie \n\n![image.png]([URL_52021])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52020])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-27T18:43:41Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-20T15:19:23Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-08-21T02:01:42Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 515775, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ENG-2135", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-27T17:05:31Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-20T15:19:23Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2038", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2117", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2117", "number": 2117, "title": "Add Haptics To the Game", "description": "We will add haptics to the game for the upcoming hotfix. I've already requested we purchase the \"Feel\" asset. The steps will be \n\n1. Make a sandbox inside the game to test 3 levels of haptics with feel \n2. Put haptics to various functions as decided by the product team \n\nHaptics to Implement: [[URL_52022])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-02-10T13:48:38Z", "completed_at": "2025-02-11T11:44:04Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-08-12T02:15:27Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 528950, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-27T17:06:39Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-11T11:44:04Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2056", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2135", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2135", "number": 2135, "title": "Change The Infinite Rewind Icon", "description": "The infinite rewind icon will be updated to include a timer next to an infinity symbol. Please access the Figma file here: \n\n[[URL_52058])\n\nIn a separate branch, we are updating the overall UI, so @[PERSON_NAME_0067] please advise Samuel if the rewind icon transition needs additional work to avoid bugs. Samuel, you can check out the new gameplay UI in [ENG-2116](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-2116/make-tiles-bigger-in-core-game)", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-15T15:15:11Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-06T16:38:38Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 363056, "labels": ["Cookie"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ENG-2116", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-02-07T16:28:07Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-06T16:38:38Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2060", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2139", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2139", "number": 2139, "title": "Streak Fever", "description": "This is a master ticket for the Live-Ops event called \"Streak Rush\". It's similar to the \"Lightning Rush event from Royal Match. The spec is here: \n\n[[URL_52062])\n\nFigma:", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-02-13T17:10:50Z", "completed_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:21Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-09-19T02:27:08Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 478270, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-02-10T16:02:21Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:21Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2062", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2140", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2140", "number": 2140, "title": "Castle Climb", "description": "This is the master mock-up ticket for the upcoming Live-Ops event Castle Climb. It's a milestone based win streak event. \n\nDocument in progress: \n[[URL_52063])\nFigma:", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-11-05T22:01:56Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 143852, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-02-10T16:04:55Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-05T22:01:56Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2094", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2171", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2139", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2171", "number": 2171, "title": "Create the screen flow for the saga map", "description": "Create the icon, placement, display and the general saga map flow for the event. \n\nIcon\nPlacement\nDisplay \nIntro Pop up \nInfographic", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-03-17T16:24:42Z", "completed_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:22Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-09-19T02:27:08Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 478270, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-02-18T18:39:21Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:22Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2095", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2172", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2139", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2172", "number": 2172, "title": "Integrate the art", "description": "Replace mockups with the final UI \nImplement VFX", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-03-17T16:24:37Z", "completed_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:22Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-09-19T02:27:08Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 478270, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-02-18T18:40:03Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:22Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2096", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2173", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2139", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2173", "number": 2173, "title": "Implement Bots", "description": "Make the event use bots. \n\n@douglas This is the part we need your help from. Can you create a ticket for yourself accordingly?", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-03-17T16:24:29Z", "completed_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:22Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-09-19T02:27:07Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 478270, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-02-18T18:42:08Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:22Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2097", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2174", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2139", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2174", "number": 2174, "title": "Implement Leaderboard", "description": "'@douglas This is the second leg of this event that [PERSON_NAME_0029] requires backend assistance with.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-03-17T16:24:27Z", "completed_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:22Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-09-19T02:27:08Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 478270, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-02-18T18:43:59Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-18T16:24:22Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2121", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2196", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2139", "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2196", "number": 2196, "title": "Streak Fever Animations", "description": "There are two animations that we will need for this feature. \n\n1. Token to Icon Animation \n\n   ![image.png]([URL_52142])\n\nAs we talked about before, we'll need to play this animation every time a level is successfully won. We will use the standardized token to icon animation and the sprite will be the flame icon Martin drew for the game. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52141])\n\n2. The streak animation \n\nEverytime player streaks within a level, they will see an animation on the tile they achieved the streak with. **So it shouldn't be coordinate based.** As the logic calls for three types of streak this animation needs to either made three ways, one for +4, one for +5, and one for +6. If you know an engineer-efficient way to do it where [PERSON_NAME_0029] can type in the number let me know. Otherwise it will be three animations there the flame grows in a short span of time (think 0.5 to 0.75 seconds) **Please use the same sprite as the token.**\n\n![image.png]([URL_52140])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-03-04T16:06:43Z", "completed_at": "2025-03-18T16:27:11Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-09-19T02:27:07Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 478267, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-02-24T10:02:26Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-18T16:27:11Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2849", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-685", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c557a2ae624e4fa1", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-685", "number": 685, "title": "Vanishing Tile Improvements", "description": "Vanishing tile loses a turn when the player uses a booster and that shouldn't be the case. Can you take a look?", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-03T17:05:34Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-19T11:23:41Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-20T05:45:58Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 958091, "labels": ["Sprint 15 - April 12th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-03-29T16:16:19Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-19T11:23:41Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2869", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-703", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c557a2ae624e4fa1", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-703", "number": 703, "title": "Bomb Tile reveals child tiles", "description": "See Slack for details \n\n[[URL_50132]) \n\n**Summary:** Bomb tile reveals child tiles when exploded on Chapter 2 Level 3 (iPhone 11 - Version 0.1.836)\n\n**Description:** On Chapter 2 Level 3 of iPhone 11 (Version 0.1.836), the Bomb tile reveals child tiles when exploded, which is not the intended behavior.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n\n1. Play Chapter 2 Level 3.\n2. Explode the bomb tile.\n\n**Expected Behavior:** The Bomb tile should not reveal child tiles when exploded on Chapter 2 Level 3 of iPhone 11, maintaining the game's mechanics and challenge level.\n\n[[URL_50131])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-08T17:00:59Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-22T12:30:12Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 953704, "labels": ["Sprint 16 - April 26th", "Main Game", "Django Blocker"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-08T16:49:01Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-22T12:30:12Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3016", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-848", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-848", "number": 848, "title": "Tutorial Editor To-Do List for Leonardo", "description": "Please see the sub-issues for each specific task.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-06T17:51:48Z", "completed_at": "2024-09-29T11:06:09Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 723388, "labels": ["Sprint 19 - June 14th", "Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:17:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-29T11:06:09Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3017", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-849", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-849", "number": 849, "title": "Adding Highlight Radius Options", "description": "Please add an option to highlight events to include radius selection. If this is not feasible with the current asset we use, please let me know and we can talk about making the default bigger as a temporary solution\n\n![image.png]([URL_50277])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-06T19:58:02Z", "completed_at": "2024-05-13T16:09:30Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 923245, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:17:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-13T16:09:30Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3018", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-850", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-850", "number": 850, "title": "Vanishing Tile Expired Trigger", "description": "I'm not sure if we can turn this into something more generic but for now, I think it only applies to the vanishing tile. We need a trigger \"Vanishing Tile Expired\" when a player doesn't match the vanishing tile and it burns away.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-06T19:07:15Z", "completed_at": "2024-06-06T15:04:47Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 888749, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:17:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-06T15:04:47Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3019", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-851", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-851", "number": 851, "title": "The Second Dialogue Box Integration", "description": "Currently, we have one text box. There is a second text bubble in Figma with a tail. We need to integrate that into the editor and add the ability to select speech bubble type in the editor. (please see the imagine below)\n\n![]([URL_50278])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-03-29T01:30:07Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 463324, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:17:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-29T01:30:07Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3020", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-852", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-852", "number": 852, "title": "Text Box Alignment Improvement", "description": "Please add:\n\nEither, more options to align the text box in addition to the 'top, center, and bottom\" we currently have. Or the ability to type in a number on the y-axis.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-06T18:21:45Z", "completed_at": "2024-06-06T15:04:44Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 888750, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:17:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-06T15:04:44Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3021", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-853", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-853", "number": 853, "title": "Chapter Start Trigger", "description": "Please add a \"Chapter Start\" trigger so I can add events when a chapter first starts. Similar to \"Puzzle Started\" trigger.\n\n![image.png]([URL_50279])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-06T22:10:15Z", "completed_at": "2024-06-06T15:05:09Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 888749, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:22:45Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-06T15:05:09Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3022", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-854", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-854", "number": 854, "title": "Prelevel dialogue tags.", "description": "I need tags for pre-level dialogue box. \n\n![image.png]([URL_50280])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-06-06T14:24:53Z", "completed_at": "2024-08-19T11:26:13Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 782408, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:26:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-08-19T11:26:13Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3023", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-855", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-855", "number": 855, "title": "Saga Map Tags", "description": "Please add tags to the red lined UI elements. \n\n![image.png]([URL_50281])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-06-06T15:04:31Z", "completed_at": "2024-08-19T11:32:19Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 782402, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:29:38Z", "updated_at": "2024-08-19T11:32:19Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3024", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-856", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-856", "number": 856, "title": "New Main Game UI tags", "description": "Since we'll change the in-game UI, I will need the tags for the new UI as a priority to fix all the tutorials.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-06-06T18:39:38Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 888535, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:35:39Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-06T18:39:38Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3030", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-862", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-862", "number": 862, "title": "Half Highlighting", "description": "![]([URL_50283])\n\nWe will use it for the CB tutorial but I think we can do a more generic version that highlights only the matchable area of a tile, it can come handy later.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-06-07T14:41:10Z", "completed_at": "2024-08-19T11:48:17Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 782386, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-30T18:22:47Z", "updated_at": "2024-08-19T11:48:17Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3031", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-863", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-863", "number": 863, "title": "Displaying Tutorial Elements in post-game screen", "description": "![]([URL_50284])\n\nI'm not sure how to go about this one. \n\nEither, we can add a trigger along the lines of \"On End Level Card Displayed.\" that will work for all end game screens regardless of the type of scene running. \n\nOr, we can make it separate for the core game, CB, and memory game.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-01-16T18:44:33Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 565970, "labels": ["Avengers", "Tutorial Editor", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-30T18:27:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-16T18:44:33Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3032", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-864", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-864", "number": 864, "title": "Tag for Match Counter", "description": "![]([URL_50285])\n\nNeed a tag for the Match Counter in CB game.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-06-06T15:50:40Z", "completed_at": "2024-06-06T15:50:57Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 888703, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-30T18:28:20Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-06T15:51:07Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3033", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-865", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-865", "number": 865, "title": "Ability to Add Button To Message Bubble", "description": "I don't remember exactly but, was \"Show Message Ok\" was supposed to do that. I might be completely misremembering this. In any case, I need the ability to show a message with a button and also the ability to write on the said bubble. If I can't right on the bubble it can say \"OK\" by default. \n\n![]([URL_50285])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-06-06T15:52:01Z", "completed_at": "2024-08-09T10:29:46Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 796865, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-30T18:32:42Z", "updated_at": "2024-08-09T10:29:46Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3034", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-866", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-866", "number": 866, "title": "Ability to Pause Conveyor Belt Game", "description": "![image.png]([URL_50286])\n\nI need to be able to pause the game so that I can this extra message.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-06T22:10:24Z", "completed_at": "2024-06-06T15:05:51Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 888748, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-30T18:43:28Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-06T15:05:51Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3112", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-940", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-940", "number": 940, "title": "TimeBoost tutorial text doesn't show", "description": "You can check the video in the tutorial editor for detailed look. \n\nI pushed the latest flow to include people who will ignore the automatic pre level dialogue. \n\nOverall, the main problem is that the text won't appear and when I make it appear with forcing \"ObjectClick\" to \"PlayLevel\" the text won't disappear.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-23T21:53:23Z", "completed_at": "2024-06-18T14:38:15Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-12-19T07:20:24Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 871496, "labels": ["Leonardo Blocker"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-05-23T18:02:11Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-18T14:38:15Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3146", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-973", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-973", "number": 973, "title": "Infinite Rewind Implementation", "description": "We need to add infinite rewind to be used as a time-boost.  It will feature Marcus's VFX where the rewind button gets replaced by a glowy one that has infinite use.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-06-18T15:55:02Z", "completed_at": "2024-08-19T11:24:23Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 782410, "labels": ["VFX Integration", "Sprint 20 - July 5th", "In-Game Boosts"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-05-30T19:39:48Z", "updated_at": "2024-08-19T11:24:23Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3147", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-974", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-973", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-974", "number": 974, "title": "Unlock infinite rewind from tutorial system", "description": "Locking unlocking as needed", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-01-16T18:44:26Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 565982, "labels": ["Avengers"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-05-30T19:39:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-16T18:44:26Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3148", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-975", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-973", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-975", "number": 975, "title": "Place infinite rewind icon on the pre-level dialogue", "description": "Placing the icon", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-07-15T07:36:28Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 833038, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-05-30T19:39:48Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-15T07:36:28Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3149", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-976", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-973", "assignee_id": "usr_PERSON_2218", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-976", "number": 976, "title": "Add infinite rewind system", "description": "The actual infinite rewind mechanic", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-07-08T16:14:25Z", "completed_at": "2024-07-09T13:46:37Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 841308, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-05-30T19:39:48Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-09T13:46:37Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3151", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-978", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-978", "number": 978, "title": "Shop localization bug when cancelling order", "description": "![image.png]([URL_50376])\n\nIf I back out from an order, I get a missing translation.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-06-17T13:03:28Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 873031, "labels": ["Hot Leo", "Shop", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-05-30T22:00:21Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-17T13:03:28Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3209", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-112", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-112", "number": 112, "title": "Infinite Lives animation (currently inactive)", "description": "Overall tone: Make it instantly clear that the player has **Infinite Lives** and make it *feel special* \u2014 energetic, but not chaotic.\n\n![image.png]([URL_52480])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52479])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52478])\n\n**Animation Elements:**\n\n1. **Infinite Heart Symbol:**\n   * Add a **gentle pulse glow** behind or around the infinite heart (\u221e\u2764\ufe0f) icon\n   * Can loop every \\~1.5 seconds\n   * Use a soft white or cyan glow to contrast with the red heart\n2. **Floating Hearts (optional but juicy):**\n   * Occasionally spawn **tiny floating hearts** that drift upward from the trash can or near the main heart icon\n   * They should fade out and shrink while rising\n   * Variation: 1 heart every \\~2\u20133 seconds, randomized height\n3. **Entry Effect (only once when state activates):**\n   * When Infinite Lives turns on, the **heart icon could spin in**, **scale up**, or even flash once with a sound cue\n   * This draws attention and makes the state change feel like a reward\n4. **Banner (top left):**\n   * If the Infinite Lives icon in the top-left (next to Full) is used:\n     * Consider animating the **infinity loop** in the icon (it can rotate or pulse)\n     * Optional: show a **faint timer bar** if lives are time-limited", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-09-23T14:17:19Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 206237, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-06T15:42:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-23T14:17:19Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3210", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-113", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-113", "number": 113, "title": "Looking for opponents animation", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52484])\n\nThe task is to animate the clock on the screenshot. The animation will be displayed on the matchmaking overlay screen (See screenshot)\n\nOverall tone: Snappy but calm. We're not rushing the player, but showing that things are *happening*.\n\n**Animation Elements:**\n\n1. **Clock Bounce:**\n   * Add a soft, idle bounce/hover loop (every \\~2 seconds)\n   * Easing: *Ease in-out*, slow and friendly\n   * Optional squash on bounce for extra juice\n\n     ![image.png]([URL_52483])\n\n2. **Clock Pulsing:**\n\n* The orange/yellow rim does a soft pulse (scale up \\~1.1x and fade back)\n* Sync with bounce or alternate rhythmically for layering\n\n![image.png]([URL_52482])\n\n3. **Clock Hand Rotation:**\n\n* Rotate the **blue minute hand** clockwise (continuous loop)\n* Speed: 1 full circle every 1\u20132 seconds\n* Optional: Add a tiny delay jitter or wobble at each \"tick\" to mimic a mechanical vibe\n* Only the tall hand moves. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52481])\n\n**Optional Extras:**\n\n* Faint glow emission from the clock center or rim\n* Animated particle blips (tiny dots or pings) fading in/out near the clock edges\n\nSFX: Timer sound", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-09T13:10:53Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-12T09:10:41Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 399504, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-06T15:42:36Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-12T09:10:41Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3211", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-114", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-114", "number": 114, "title": "Card pack ripping animation", "description": "The card pack rigging animation will be done using a bone system. This way, we can animate all the the card as long as their shape doesn't shape. \n\nOverall vibe: The players will see this animation A LOT. So the animation should be fast enough, but still appealing.\n\nThe generic flow: \n\n1. The pack comes onto the screen from small to big. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52488])\n\n2.  for \"Tap to Open\" action to take place. (we're not doing the hand)\n\n   ![image.png]([URL_52487])\n\n\n3. The pack rips open. As the sides come apart the card is revealed. When the ripped card parts are out of the screen, the card becomes bigger. From there 3 scenerios can happen:\n\na. Displays a \"new\" tag if the player doesn't own the item and let players to clam.\nb. Don't display the new tag if the player already owns. Players can claim.   \n\n![image.png]([URL_52486])\n\nc. The cards can turn into bones. \n\n(Marcus will fill the details. But basically, the card will spin into a vertex and come back out with a satisfying counter animation until the bones come out. Meanwhile, the text for the card will go down in the counter, and after it hits 0, go back up as the image becomes bones)\n\n![image.png]([URL_52485])\n\n \n\nSFX: Ripping sound, swoosh.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-13T22:25:11Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-09T16:13:30Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 358761, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-06T15:43:59Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-09T16:13:30Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3212", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-115", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-115", "number": 115, "title": "Gold Flying Animation", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52496])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52495])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-12T09:12:10Z", "completed_at": "2025-07-08T23:03:59Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 316590, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-07T11:54:13Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-08T23:04:01Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3213", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-116", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-116", "number": 116, "title": "Quest and Achievements UI", "description": "The same as Domino Dreams in Zombie Match UI style", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-06-17T16:34:07Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 347220, "labels": ["2D Art"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-12T06:52:24Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-17T16:34:07Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3214", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-117", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-117", "number": 117, "title": "Trophy Road UI/UX", "description": "This is next one after Quests and Achievements. Detailed tickets incoming.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-06-17T16:34:11Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 347220, "labels": ["UI", "UI/UX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-12T06:52:58Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-17T16:34:11Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3215", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-118", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-118", "number": 118, "title": "Shop Animations Master Ticket", "description": "Marcus, I'm adding each of the animation items as a subtask, since they are all shop animations. Please reach out on Slack if you have questions.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 368019, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-12T06:55:42Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T08:27:59Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3216", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-119", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-118", "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-119", "number": 119, "title": "Shine for gold and gem piles.", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52507])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52506])\n\nWe have coin and gems piles in the game shop. I tried to highlight them all. But keep in mind, these might change or more can be added. So, per our discussion these icons can benefit from a little sparkle. \n\nIn our discussion, we decided to try to purple sparkle we already have for the purple box. If it doesn't work, we can explore other options. Please let me know early on if this doesn't work. \n\nIt tried some things for you:\n\n1. Changing outer glow color \n2. Changing star size \n3. Playing with transparency\n4. Change star positions slightly. (didn't try)\n5. Cut the PNG in half and try on smaller scale (didn't try)\n\nI think they all have their place and look cute. Maybe animation where the transparency changes in **2 second loops** while some start become smaller and bigger can look very cute. But feel free to experiment with what you want. I think you already have an idea what do do. Let me know what you think.\n\n![image.png]([URL_52505])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52504])\n\nImportant: This shine is ideally one size or one prefab and can be used for any container and gem pile size.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353467, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-12T07:20:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T08:27:20Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3218", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-120", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-118", "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-120", "number": 120, "title": "Background glow And fireflies for containers", "description": "Per our discussion, we're considering adding some glow and firefiles to the containers in the shop. The containers in question are all over the shop but we're mainly considering the specials section. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52512])\n\nWe already have the glow and fireflies from the Plague Race. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52511])\n\nI showed you some mock ups, but adding them here too. Here, as you can see I tried the affect on that containers (blue, yellow, and purple) and they look cute. But they need your touch to not look as tacky as they are here \ud83d\ude00 \n\n![image.png]([URL_52510])\n\nIf we're going to have this kind of animation, I prefer they are first on the high prize special offers. Which are these: \n\n![image.png]([URL_52509])\n\n\nIf you think it won't be crowded and all containers could benefit from the animation, and you want to add animation to the blue ones as well, then we have to show progression. In that case, the animation should also progress. So, a softer version of the animation for the blue containers and intensifying all the way. The orange has the strongest effect. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52508])\n\nAs for how to animate the glow and fireflies, up to you. But in my opinion simple size change (1.1x-1.3x) and firefly transparency transition will do. If you have a more elaborate thing in mind, please let me know. Also let me know, if the glow and fireflies we have are not compatible for an animation so I provide other resources.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-06-02T05:38:53Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-13T01:18:26Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353896, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-12T07:21:27Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T01:18:26Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3219", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-121", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-118", "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-121", "number": 121, "title": "Card pack animation in the shop", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52516])\n\nIn the rotating shop, we have a bigger container for the \"gem for cards\" section. This card needs to animate to make it more enticing for the players to buy. Since you said animating the guy on the card isn't feasible, then the card itself needs to do something. We agreed to try a \"swoosh swoosh\" type animation for the card, something that will highlight it's plasticly/aluminum feel. This animation should loop once per shop animation and shouldn't loop. Ideally it's 2-2,5 seconds long. \n\nBasically, the idea is to apply distorting force to several points in the object and make it swish. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52515])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52514])\n\nHere is a sequence example I made with AI. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52513])\n\nIf this is not what you had in mind when we talked about it, or it proves to be too time consuming, please reach out so we can create another solution.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353467, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-12T07:55:19Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T08:27:18Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3220", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-122", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-118", "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-122", "number": 122, "title": "Simple animations for offers bands and labels.", "description": "The bands and labels can benefit from some ninju-minju **if we have extra time.** I still think we should do it in the end but, for now I'm happy to throw this one into the backlog if you run out of time or it's too much time for the engineer. \n\n1. The red label animation.\n   \n   We have a label like this. The text on it can change based on the message. Basically, if this \"new\" tag is displayed, we can play an animation once to make it really obvious.  \n\n   ![image.png]([URL_52523])\n\n   A simple pulse or resizing is enough, feel free to add some shine for extra polish. \n\n   ![image.png]([URL_52522])\n\n   2\\. Discount Banner animation.\n   \n   It will be really cool if we can animate the discount banner, a few examples of how it's used are here. \n\n   ![image.png]([URL_52521])\n\n   ![image.png]([URL_52520])\n\n   ![image.png]([URL_52519])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52518])\n\n\nThe idea is to make this banner more dynamic in a sequence like this. Basically it's just moving the text container on the ribbon **once** when the players scrolls there. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52517])", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353467, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-12T07:57:55Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T08:27:43Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3229", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-130", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-130", "number": 130, "title": "Create an out of moves screen flow with offers", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 396118, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-14T17:36:10Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-14T17:36:10Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3469", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-349", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-349", "number": 349, "title": "Add tool tips to the leaderboard and quests chests", "description": "Please add tooltips for the chests that are displayed in the leaderboards.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-07-10T21:04:08Z", "completed_at": "2025-07-17T10:05:38Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2026-01-18T04:45:07Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 304409, "labels": ["Engineering"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-07-04T17:49:59Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-17T10:05:38Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3470", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-35", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-35", "number": 35, "title": "Reward Box 2D Opening Animation", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52355])\n\nFigma Link: [https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=782-2&p=f&t=VRKdThpBQWvZBKD4-0](https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=782-2&p=f&t=VRKdThpBQWvZBKD4-0)\n\n\nWe need a **short, snappy 2D animation** for the Weekly Contest reward screen. The animation should bring the purple reward chest to life in a way that feels satisfying and rewarding, but **fast-paced and skippable**. \n\nThe animation leads into the **reward icon reveal** (handled separately in development). So, we need to account for that when deciding the timing of the box opening animation. \n\nGuidelines:\n\n* You can decide the animation direction. Both opening up and sliding to the side are acceptable. But I think a small wobble followed by a generic opening upward is the most satisfying. \n* Animation should be **no longer than 0.5-1 second,** since we need to spare time for the icon reveal, as well. The whole scene should take more than 2 seconds. \n* Motion should be **clean and sharp**\u2014 let's avoid floaty easing or long anticipation.\n* This part of the animation should support being **interruptible** without breaking the icon reveal and claim flow, **just in case** we decide to add a skipping /freezing later.\n  without breaking the claim flow.\n* Please use **simple VFX flourishes** as needed (light burst, sparkles), but keep it aligned with our current visual style.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-06T08:19:52Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-13T01:19:21Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353895, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-21T08:35:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T01:19:21Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3580", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-450", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-450", "number": 450, "title": "Minor Improvements Throughout The Game", "description": "We'll have three minor improvements. Non-urgent but nice to have before the next release.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-08-01T17:26:45Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 282368, "labels": ["Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-08-01T17:26:45Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-01T17:29:49Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3581", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-451", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-450", "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-451", "number": 451, "title": "Coin consistency", "description": "Please make sure all the coin icons usage in the game uses the same sprite with the skull icon. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52759])", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-08-14T14:56:00Z", "completed_at": "2025-08-18T16:17:59Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 257956, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-08-01T17:27:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-18T16:17:59Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3582", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-452", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-450", "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-452", "number": 452, "title": "Change avatars with new art throughout the game.", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52761])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52760])", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-08-14T14:56:05Z", "completed_at": "2025-08-18T16:18:02Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 257956, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-08-01T17:29:10Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-18T16:18:02Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3583", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-453", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-450", "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-453", "number": 453, "title": "Fix text inconsistency", "description": "[PERSON_NAME_0040] to make a list of all uppercase, lowercase text placement \nAnd we need to standardize the infographic screens.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 282364, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-08-01T17:29:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-01T17:31:09Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3609", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-478", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-478", "number": 478, "title": "Add generic animations to the event icon system.", "description": "Add the generic animations Marcus made into the system.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-09-17T15:50:33Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 214784, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-08-14T16:37:00Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-17T15:50:33Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3641", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-507", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-507", "number": 507, "title": "Create an extra camera to display effect videos", "description": "[PERSON_NAME_0022] to chat with other engineers for tech set up", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-09-22T15:09:14Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 207625, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-08-26T19:03:01Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-22T15:09:14Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3642", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-508", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-508", "number": 508, "title": "Assisted Start", "description": "When the player is off rails after level 3, and they don't interact with the screen for \"x seconds\" (please make adjustable) the zombie hand sprite will point at the play button until the button is clicked. \n\nThe system works as a part of the FTUE system, but without any additional highlights and so on. \n\nPlease include a simple bouncing and moving back and forth animation for the hand sprite.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-09T15:16:51Z", "completed_at": "2025-10-13T16:29:43Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 177305, "labels": ["FTUE", "Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-08-27T17:36:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-13T16:29:43Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3726", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-586", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-586", "number": 586, "title": "Change Backgrounds In the Game", "description": "Please add the new backgrounds in to the game. The backgrounds can be found on Figma on this page. \n\n\n![image.png]([URL_52921])\n\n[https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=13-7&p=f&t=MeI1RhrJXAeSWFe1-0](https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=13-7&p=f&t=MeI1RhrJXAeSWFe1-0)\n\nPlease note these backgrounds are designed for iPad size and needs to optimized for various device sizes. Follow the general practice in place and if you have any questions, talk with [PERSON_NAME_0120], who set the system in the first place. For any lightning issues, please check in with Marcus. \n\nPlease let me know the branch name you'll be working on, in the comments on Linear below. \n\nWe will use the port image for the infinite boss mode and the rest of the backgrounds will rotate inside the main game.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-06T17:50:52Z", "completed_at": "2025-10-14T12:21:28Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 176113, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:37:03Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-14T12:21:28Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3730", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-59", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-59", "number": 59, "title": "Create Test Levels For Object Composition", "description": "We want to test the current resize on tap area logic. \n\n1. Creating a range of Unity primitives based on tap real estate on the board\n   (Baseline range)\n2. Levels where primitives and resembling objects are side by side \n   (Perceptual consistency evaluation)\n3. Levels with multiple primitives and multiple resembling objects side by side. \n   (Real-world scaling composition evaluation)\n   \n   \n   Branch Active: [PERSON_NAME_0019]/itemcompositiontest\n   \n   Task 1: Decide Min-Max Threshold \n   \n   We need to decide what's the smallest and largest tap area we allow players on an object from a difficulty and aesthetics standpoint. \n   \n   a. Minimum First \n   \n   The minimum tap area should be visible on the screen. If levels are made out of the smallest tap area objects, it shouldn't look absurd. And it should still be clickable comfortably. \n   \n   b. Maximum Second\n   \n   The max is more straightforward. It shouldn't be big enough that the object looks too out of place especially compared to the decided small item. Think sheriff bagde vs couch. \n   \n   To help decide, these are the test levels (unchecked for prod)\n   \n   1. CylinderMinTapArea\n   \n   Shows beer mugs (bulky cylinder) with 0.2, 0.25, 0.3, and 0.35 script sizing. \n   \n   2. BadgeMinTapArea\n   \n    Show badges (flat small) with 0.25, 0.275, and 0.3 script sizing. \n\n      3\\. RakeMinTapArea\n\n      Rakes in different colors, 0.5,0.6, and 0.7 in script sizing. \n\n      4\\. BeerMaxTap\n      \n Beers in different sizes 0.6, 0.7, and 0.8 in script sizing and a 0.3 beer mug for comparison    and perceptual consistency.\n\n5. CouchMaxTap\n   \n   This is the bulkiest object so it's the ultimate threshold for maximum tap area. This level has couch script sizes 0.75, 0.85, and 0.95 and a 0.3 beer mug for comparison.\n\nTask 2: Decide shape categories (prefab sizing among peers)\n\nEvery item gets a shape label according to these categories \n\n1. Narrow Vertical (fork, pen, wine bottle, billiard stick)\n2. Flat (chocolate, plate, pizza box, badge, music note, letters)\n3. Bulky Polygon (gift box, washing machine, barrel)\n4. Bulky Wide (couch, fridge, bicycle)\n5. Tall Irregular (lamp, plunger)\n\n\nTask 3: Define global min and max for each shape\n\n1. For example the smallest narrow vertical item we will have in the game is a \"rake\"\n2. The smallest flat item we will have in the game is \"badge\"\n\nTask 4: Resize things accordingly.\n\nDon't over adjust", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-04-23T08:55:32Z", "completed_at": "2025-04-30T01:27:54Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 417246, "labels": ["(ZM) Game Design"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-23T08:55:32Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-30T01:27:54Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3741", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-60", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-60", "number": 60, "title": "Zombie Ops #2 Spec (Brain Chase)", "description": "This the collectibles-based LiveOps event, aka **zombie version of Win and Collect.** Working title is Brain Chase with the alternate event name Serum Therapy. \n\nHere are some brain storm jump points for when we are ready to tackle this spec. \n\n* Collectible ideas: brains, tombstones, serums, worms, spiders (cute edition)\n  \n  Iteration idea: If we go with worms and spiders, we can make them moving so player feels like \"catching\" them. Adds to the fun and replays the same emotion in Royal Match where moving blocks of the collectible affects the collectible state. \n\n\n* Brain Chase is a time-limited event consisting of several steps. Each step has its collectible item goal and reward. You collect the items within the level by just tapping them while playing a level.\n  \n  Alternative: We can make it a match 3 to get the collectible item to keep it dynamic, similar to how you have to make a propeller in Royal Match to keep the mechanic one step above the mere collect.\n   \n* When players collect the item goal of a step, they need to finish the level to claim it. Thus, extra collectibles for hard and epic levels. \n  \n  Alternative: Multiply rewards with rewarded ad? \n* The event has progression within itself. When you complete all steps in the event, you win the Grand Prize.\n* Some name ideas: Brain Chase, Serum Therapy, Ghoul Goals, Zombie Zing, Graveyard Dash", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-06-23T18:25:14Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 338469, "labels": ["(ZM) Game Design"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-23T11:24:33Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-23T18:25:14Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3752", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-61", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_Robert", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-61", "number": 61, "title": "Zombie Gamemode #1 Spec (Operation: No Exit) \"Endless Mode\"", "description": "We are going to add an \"Endless Mode\" as the first game mode of Zombie Match 3D. Working title is Operation: No Exit. \n\nAlternate names: Forever Brains, Till Death Loops Us Apart, Last Zom Standing, Match \u2018Em Dead\n\nThere isn't a lot of art need for this one, just simple pre-level dialogue UIs and perhaps a few differentiators for the level. \n\nSome brain storm jump points. \n\nMechanic #1 Item Dump \n\nIf we want to make the endless mode more about matching, we can go an item dump to the board in fixed intervals. That way, there is a clear fail condition to end the endless of the endless mode and players can be scored based on how long they survived. If the board gets full beyond allowed capacity, we fail. Extra hard if each item dump has different items. \n\nPros: Perfect for the match-oriented players. \nCons: Can get frustrating very quickly. \n\nMechanic #2 Zombie Difficulty\n\nIf we want to focus on zombie killing aspect to engage the players, we can opt for giving players ammunition of the same item set and weapon items to make them carrots on the otherwise repetitive mode. The zombie waves get progressively harder and if they reach the cannon; it's game over. \n\nPros: Has flow, momentum, and possibility to help players zone out with repetitive action. \nCons: If the player is more of a \"matcher\", they won't find it challenging enough because zombies won't do much for them.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-06-23T18:23:43Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 338471, "labels": ["(ZM) Game Design"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-23T11:42:35Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-23T18:23:43Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3763", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-62", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-62", "number": 62, "title": "Zombie Ops #3 Spec (Dead Eye)", "description": "This is the first try/win-streak-based LiveOps event, aka the zombie version of Axe Arena. The working title is Brains Aims. Some other fun names could be: Brains Aims, Aims For Brains, Skull Shot, Rot Shot, Cannon Fodder, Boom Bloom.\n\nThe visuals are minimal for this spec, essentially only an icon theme selection. The spec and infrastructure are easily copied.\n\n![image.png]([URL_52385])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52384])\n\nSome brainstorm starter themes and iteration ideas:\n\n1. Shooting board with a zombie head nailed on it by an axe (complete reuse of assets if we're on a crunch), or an arrow. \n2. An icon based on a theme: brain, cannonball, tombstone. Anything to replace the helmet of Helmet Rush.   \n3. Multipliers come with evolving icons. For example, a humble cross tombstone for x1 and a full crypt for x10. Or military officer ranks based on our main hero. \n4. Are we going to tie it to a currency like in Match Factory? We can give out a currency like cannon ammunition to be a win-streak booster style shield for the cannon. Or health packs that temporarily increase the cannon's HP.", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 426642, "labels": ["(ZM) Game Design", "30 June"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-23T12:42:22Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-24T16:37:03Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3768", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-624", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-624", "number": 624, "title": "Make The First 3 Levels Use The Original Buildings Background", "description": "Right now, the game has a rotating background image system that was previously done.\n\nPlease iterate the system so that: \n\nLevels 1,2, and 3 use the original buildings background that we had. \n\nNote: I'd make a system so that we can add to the list of numbers a certain background can be used at. That way if we iterate, it can be a simple line change. Please consider this approach if it's not too much additional time.", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-20T17:23:52Z", "completed_at": "2025-10-23T11:46:42Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 163188, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-20T17:23:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-23T11:46:42Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3770", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-626", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-626", "number": 626, "title": "Zombie Match Lite Master Ticket Main Menu", "description": "The master ticket for the light version of the zombie match. This ticket will include everything related to iteration independent of department.  \n\n[[URL_52963])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165704, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T17:50:45Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:06:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3771", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-627", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-626", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-627", "number": 627, "title": "Remove Endless Mode from the icon management system", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165554, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:20:21Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:20:21Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3772", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-628", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-626", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-628", "number": 628, "title": "Remove Endless Mode from the FTUE", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165554, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:20:30Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:20:30Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3773", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-629", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-626", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-629", "number": 629, "title": "Remove Infinite Boss Mode from icon management system", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165553, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:06Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3774", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-63", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-63", "number": 63, "title": "Zombie Ops #4 Quests and Achievements Spec", "description": "Blank spec and excel sheet for the list of quests and achivements\n[[URL_52387])\n[[URL_52386])\n\nList of quests and achievements need to be filled in.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-06-23T18:23:18Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-23T18:23:29Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 338471, "labels": ["(ZM) Game Design"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-23T17:12:20Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-23T18:23:29Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3775", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-630", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-626", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-630", "number": 630, "title": "Remove Infinite Boss Mode from FTUE", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165553, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:12Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:12Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3776", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-631", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-626", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-631", "number": 631, "title": "Lock the Cards Menu Item", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52966])\n\nWe need to lock out this menu item that previously led to the cards page. It will not be opened for this iteration. \n\n\n![image.png]([URL_52965])\n\n\nThe locks are arbitrary on the mock up, please only lock the cards menu item. \nYou can find the corresponding UI on Figma. \n\n[https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=8711-16&p=f&t=jn4Fs2Cg4X58Biak-0](https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=8711-16&p=f&t=jn4Fs2Cg4X58Biak-0)\n\nPlease don't make a PR to main, as this is the \"lite\" project. Let us know in the zombie-match-lite channel on Slack to be merged into the \"lite\" branch. [PERSON_NAME_0022] will oversee the merges.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165553, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T13:39:20Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3777", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-632", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-626", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-632", "number": 632, "title": "Place \"Coming Soon\" Text over the locked cards menu item", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165553, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:43Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:43Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3778", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-633", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-626", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-633", "number": 633, "title": "Remove cards from the FTUE", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165552, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:48Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3779", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-634", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-626", "assignee_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-634", "number": 634, "title": "Remove card infographics from the game", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165552, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:21:58Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T13:52:06Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3780", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-635", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-635", "number": 635, "title": "Zombie Match Lite Master Ticket LiveOps", "description": "Everything concerning liveops in the new iteration lorem ipsum", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165038, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:23:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T04:56:45Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3781", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-636", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-636", "number": 636, "title": "Zombie Match Lite Master Ticket Live Ops", "description": "Everything concerning LiveOps portion of the iteration", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165547, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:27:13Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:18:11Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3782", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-637", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-637", "number": 637, "title": "Remove card packs from the shop", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52969])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52968])\n\nCurrently, the shop has 2 places that contain card packs: \n\n1. The cards tab: This tab has to be removed altogether. \n2. Daily offers: Daily offers have card packs in them that need to be removed. \n\nThis task is dependent on the design change of the Excel sheet. If the task is not done, please coordinate with the designer responsible. \n\n[ZOM-664](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-664/remove-card-packs-from-the-shop-sheet)\n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165547, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-664", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:27:27Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T13:40:12Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3783", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-638", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-638", "number": 638, "title": "Comment out card pack as rewards on the client side", "description": "[PERSON_NAME_0022], feel free to fill in any technical details. Per our conversation, the card packs need to be commented out in the client side to not send any unwanted requests to the backend. \n\nThe goal for the design is: \n\n1. Not having any items bugged because of missing card references or mechanics. \n2. Not having any bugs in rewards due to cards not being available in the game anymore. \n   \n   GDD Folder Link:\n   [[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165546, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:28:27Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T14:01:04Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3784", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-639", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-639", "number": 639, "title": "Redo rewards that were previously card packs", "description": "When redoing the economy replace all card pack placements with new things. Dependent on economy changes as a whole, details TBD. \n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165545, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:29:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T14:01:09Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3786", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-640", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "In Progress", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-640", "number": 640, "title": "Remove anything zombie from quests and achievements", "description": "Please go through the list of quests of achievements. Detect any quests or achievements related to the zombie killings, boss busters, cards etc (anything related to the zombies) and assess what we are left with. After this task move on with the secondary task: \n\n[ZOM-641](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-641/add-quests-and-achievements-specific-to-the-new-iteration)\n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-22T17:52:57Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 164261, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-641", "type": "relates"}, {"target": "ZOM-663", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:29:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:52:57Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3787", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-641", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "In Progress", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-641", "number": 641, "title": "Add Quests and Achievements Specific to the New Iteration", "description": "Please create new quest and achievement ideas related to the new iteration. Make sure we have an acceptably long list and consult with [PERSON_NAME_0022] and Douglas on how long it would take to add them in. Share your cost estimation in the low-fat-zombie-match channel for assessment. After product approval, make the new Excel sheet and move with the rest of the production. \n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-22T17:53:00Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 164261, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-640", "type": "relates"}, {"target": "ZOM-663", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:29:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:53:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3788", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-642", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "In Validation", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-642", "number": 642, "title": "Remove Game Modes From the Event Icon System", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52970])\n\nPlease remove the Endless Mode and Infinite Boss Mode from the event icon system. These icons should no longer appear as a Live-Ops system of the new iteration.  \n\nNote: **Do not remove the game modes themselves**. We can iterate and bring them back if the version does well. \n\nNote: Remove from the queue manager if needed\n\nNote: Consult with backend if they need to be removed/disabled by any capacity from the backend. \n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-22T22:17:51Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 163996, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:30:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T22:17:51Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3789", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-643", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-643", "number": 643, "title": "Remove Effect Milestones From Trophy Road", "description": "Since we are removing the card mechanic, we need to remove everything related to them including the Trophy Road FTUE introductions. \n\n\n![image.png]([URL_52971])\n\n\nPlease copy the current Trophy Road sheet and create a new one, then place it in the new folder of documents created for the Lite iteration.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165542, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:32:12Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T13:21:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3790", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-644", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-644", "number": 644, "title": "Zombie Match Lite Master Ticket Core Game", "description": "Everything related to the core game of the lite iteration", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165541, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:33:43Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T14:58:52Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3791", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-645", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "In Validation", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-645", "number": 645, "title": "Create a \"main\" branch for the lite version", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-22T14:15:59Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 164478, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:36:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T15:44:26Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3792", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-646", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-646", "number": 646, "title": "Disable/delete the Zombies and Effects For Performance Improvement", "description": "The ticket is approved to go on. \n\nThe zombies will be \"deleted\" **from the lite branch only.** \n\nPlease keep in mind, we might consider doing zombie iterations later on, so do not delete them on any other branches.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165537, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:37:01Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T15:45:10Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3793", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-647", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-647", "number": 647, "title": "Turn Bypass item count into objective islands via puzzle editor", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165537, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:37:34Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:37:34Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3794", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-648", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-648", "number": 648, "title": "Turn bypass order into objective sprites via the puzzle editor", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165536, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:37:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:37:52Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3796", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-650", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-650", "number": 650, "title": "Create the Magnet Booster and Change the Icon", "description": "The details of the new booster you'll be building are here. \n\n[ZOM-665](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-665/design-the-new-hoover-booster)\n\nIf there is missing information or edge cases, please contact the designer responsible for the ticket. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52972])\n\nThe booster will change the previous catapult booster in the core game UI.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165536, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-665", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:38:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:45:03Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3797", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-651", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-651", "number": 651, "title": "Move the deck the the bottom", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52973])\n\nPlease do the change shown above. In the core game scene, the matching deck that was previously below the minimap will now reside on top of the boosters.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165535, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:39:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T15:49:16Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3798", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-652", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-652", "number": 652, "title": "Align the object pile to the middle of the screen", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52974])\n\nThe object pile needs to insentiate in the middle of the screen as shown in the mock up above.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165534, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:40:43Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:06:20Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3799", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-653", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-653", "number": 653, "title": "Import the New UI and Match it the the mockup inside the ticket", "description": "All the new UI that needs be imported can be found here: \n[https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=8711-16&p=f&t=NMrFFSgCExRq9woW-0](https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=8711-16&p=f&t=NMrFFSgCExRq9woW-0)\n\n\n\n![image.png]([URL_52975])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165533, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:40:57Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:08:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3800", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-654", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-654", "number": 654, "title": "Create a timer for the level and tie it to the fail condition", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52978])\n\n\nInstead of all the zombie mechanics, we now have a timer mechanic. Every level now has a set timer; the value is derived from the level editor. \n\n1. When the timer reach zero we display the new fail screen: \n\n   ![image.png]([URL_52977])\n2. If the player accepts to pay the coins they go back to the level with 120 seconds added to their timer.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165533, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:41:17Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:36:21Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3801", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-655", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-655", "number": 655, "title": "Create the level number indicator", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165533, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:41:32Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:41:32Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3802", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-656", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-656", "number": 656, "title": "Place objective islands into the core game", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165532, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:41:50Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:41:50Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3803", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-657", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-657", "number": 657, "title": "Create the objective system and tie it to the win condition", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165532, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:42:33Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T20:42:33Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3804", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-659", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-659", "number": 659, "title": "Add the hoover booster to the backend rewards", "description": "This is ticket is based on the design ticket here. \n\n[ZOM-665](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-665/design-the-new-hoover-booster)\n\nPlease read the document carefully and ask for revisions if there is incomplete info. \n\nThis booster will be placed into the backend to be given out later as rewards as well as being sold on the shop.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165525, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-665", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:49:26Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T15:40:23Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3806", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-660", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-660", "number": 660, "title": "Add the hoover to the shop and economy", "description": "[PERSON_NAME_0092], after the booster is done, we need to add it to the new economy sheets and stuff. End of ticket, lol.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165524, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:49:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T15:43:37Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3807", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-661", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-661", "number": 661, "title": "Add New Store Images For the Lite Iteration", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52980])\n\nWe'll need to store visuals changed in both stores. Before the submission, please renew the images on the store pages. The images can be found on Figma. \n\n[[URL_52979]) (TBC)", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165523, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:51:41Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T13:24:48Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3808", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-662", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-662", "number": 662, "title": "Place IV and RV", "description": "Please create a separate sheet for the IV and RV portions of the Lite iteration. Make sure you're using the Lite GDD folder for easy access. \n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165521, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:53:15Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T14:00:28Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3809", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-663", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-663", "number": 663, "title": "Implement the New Quests and Achievements List", "description": "This task requires the following design tickets to be completed. \n\n[ZOM-640](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-640/remove-anything-zombie-from-quests-and-achievements)\n\n[ZOM-641](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-641/add-quests-and-achievements-specific-to-the-new-iteration)\n\nPlease check the documentation is in order before you move on with the task. If everything is in place, please coordinate with the designer and implement the new quests into the \"Lite\" Iteration. \n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 164628, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-640", "type": "relates"}, {"target": "ZOM-641", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:46:05Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T15:00:15Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3810", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-664", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-664", "number": 664, "title": "Remove Card Packs From the Shop Sheet", "description": "Please create a new Shop Sheet  and place it in the Lite GDD folder. Remove all references to cards.\n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 164522, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-637", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:31:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T14:00:02Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3811", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-665", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": "usr_Robert", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-665", "number": 665, "title": "Design the New Magnet Booster", "description": "Update: this is now going to be a magnet. This way it's simple without needing VFX work.\n\nSince Catapult is out, we need to bring in a new booster similar to the booster in the Match Factory. We need to make a simple design document for the new booster before it can be implemented into the core game and the backend. \n\nThe purpose of the booster is to destroy one set of \"objective\" items. Please make sure to include edge cases like \"what if pressed when there are no objectives left,\" etc. Be stingy with the visual effects and try to use the ones we already have. \n\nPlease place your document here: \n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 164275, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-659", "type": "relates"}, {"target": "ZOM-650", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:37:16Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:39:46Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3812", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-666", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "In Validation", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-666", "number": 666, "title": "Remove Feats Of Strengths From Leaderboards", "description": "Remove zombie related feats of strength from the leaderboards. \n\n\n![image.png]([URL_52981])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-22T22:17:48Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 163996, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:18:11Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T22:17:48Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3815", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-669", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-644", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-669", "number": 669, "title": "Make The New Winstreak Adjustments", "description": "Previously we had two winstreak rewards, the glue bucket and the trampoline. Now these will change into a rocket and an hourglass. \n\n\n![image.png]([URL_52988])\n\n1. The winstreak is still capped at 5. \n2. Players get rockets and hourglasses in their pile based on their winstreak level (this rule is already in place). For example, if they have 3/5 winstreak, they start the level with 3 hourglasses and 3 rockets in their pile. \n3. If player clicks the hourglass, it adds **12 seconds** to the timer in the level. This number can change so please expose the value in the editor. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52987])\n\n4 If the timer comes from the select booster portion, it gives 30 seconds instead. \n\n5. If the player clicks the rocket, 3 more rockets come out of it and make a match instead of the player. See the Match Factory reference here: \n   \n   [[URL_52986])\n   \n   If there is only a single set of items remaining in the level, and the rocket doesn't get clicked by that point, it becomes unclickable. \n\n6. If players click on either the hourglass or the rocket under \"select boosters\" section, these boosters apply automatically at level start. \n\nNote: The UI is currently in progress. When that changes I will add a Figma link here. But they will in the same \"Lite\" page on Figma with everything else.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 161555, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:58:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:33:03Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3830", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-78", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-78", "number": 78, "title": "Event Calendar For Zombie Match 3D", "description": null, "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 422532, "labels": ["Backend Engineering"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-26T09:21:59Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-26T09:21:59Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3833", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-81", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_7fe31e7ec8199618", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-81", "number": 81, "title": "Make 3D coin piles for Zombie Match 3D", "description": "'@Martin.Walsh @[PERSON_NAME_0040]  [PERSON_NAME_0040], we need piles of gold with the zombie currency, similar process to what we did in Domino Delights.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-02T13:23:35Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-09T11:14:15Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 403700, "labels": ["3D Art"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-29T11:16:08Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-09T11:14:15Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3834", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-82", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-82", "number": 82, "title": "Plague Race UI/UX", "description": "Per the art kick off there is the list of art needs as sub tasks.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-05T16:20:46Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-13T01:18:53Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353895, "labels": ["2D Art", "UI/UX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-29T14:46:03Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T01:18:53Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3835", "field": "creator_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f